## Risks and responses

<row>
  <text>
    ### Risks

    - One supplier provides a third of our stock
    - Currency swings in the East
    - Hiring is slower than the plan
  </text>
  <step>
    <text>
      ### Responses

      - Qualify a second supplier by December
      - Invoice in local currency, hedge the rest
      - Two contractors start in November
    </text>
  </step>
</row>
